Happy Radio Lads! Don’t mind if I do.
Lou Sanders joined the boys to share some fascinating egg facts, Matthew posed the question ‘what makes you pull your foghorn?’, and Ed reviews Pale Face Swiss, which he assures us is a band.
Thanks for downloading the podcast – remember, you can be an Early Worm and catch the show live on Radio X every Sunday 8am – 11am.
